<view class="screen"><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在更新预约…</view><view wx:if="{{item}}"><view class="eyebrow">RESERVATION / {{item.kind_label}}</view><view class="status-title">{{item.status_label}}</view><view class="detail-code">{{item.code}}</view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">{{item.resource_name}}</view><view class="card-meta">{{item.time_label}}</view><view class="kv top-gap"><text class="kv-key">实验室</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.lab_name}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">确认方式</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.approval_mode === 'AUTO' ? '自动确认' : '人工审核'}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">使用目的</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.purpose}}</text></view><view class="kv" wx:if="{{item.kind === 'ROOM'}}"><text class="kv-key">参与人数</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.participants}} 人</text></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.reason}}">{{item.reason}}</view></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.status === 'PENDING'}}">申请正在等待管理员审核。待审核申请不占用时段，请以最终结果为准。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.status === 'CONFIRMED' && !item.review_required}}">请在预约开始后按规定到场，由管理员核验并办理领取或入场。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.review_required}}">此预约正在复核，暂不能办理设备领取或场地入场，请等待管理员处理。</view><view class="section-label">预约进度</view><view class="card"><view class="timeline-item" wx:for="{{item.timeline}}" wx:for-item="event" wx:key="id"><view class="timeline-title">{{event.label}}</view><view class="timeline-time">{{event.time_label}} · {{event.actor}}</view><view class="timeline-reason">{{event.reason}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{item.can_cancel}}"><view class="section-label">需要调整计划？</view><view class="card"><text class="field-label">取消原因</text><view class="field-box"><textarea value="{{form.reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：课程安排调整" maxlength="1500" /></view><button hover-class="control-pressed" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="danger-button top-gap" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" loading="{{busy}}">取消本次预约</button><view class="hint">仅可取消本人尚未开始且未使用的预约。</view></view></view></view></view>
